# ---- NyayDwar: generated / bulky files ----
# Test data (local_data.json, drafts, messages, photos, signed documents) IS committed
# while the app is in testing. Before real case data is entered, re-add these lines:
#   backend/local_data.json  backend/deposition_drafts/  backend/message_files/
#   backend/profile_photos/  backend/signed_documents/
# signed test PDFs carry a real DSC signature - kept off GitHub
backend/signed_documents/
# typing undo history: very large (one file is ~85 MB) and changes on every keystroke
backend/deposition_versions/
# temporary signing requests (expire in 30 minutes)
backend/sign_jobs/
# Sign Bridge packages are built by signing-bridge/build_packages.sh (too large for git)
backend/downloads/
# logs / run files
*.log
backend/server.pid
# frontend build output (rebuilt with npm run build)
frontend/build/
# local backups and scratch
backups/
tmp/
# example settings files (no secrets) are committed
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
